      "content": "It's as if you feel like you're facing an insurmountable bill and no one acknowledges the debt you owe, which can lead to feelings of resentment and despair. It might be time to shift from trying to recoup what's lost to considering what you can rebuild and move forward with, even if it's not the same. Focusing on the present moment, rather than dwelling on the past, may help you find a more hopeful path.",
